; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1702  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1703  \CM CM_OS_APPGETERRORHOOK_N
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1704        Precondition ensures that the pointer is valid. The compliance of the precondition is check during review.
