; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1708        Precondition ensures that the pointer is valid. The compliance of the precondition is check during review.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1709        The caller ensures, that the returned pointer is not used for write accesses, if the pointer is NULL_PTR.
