; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1711  \CM CM_OS_APPID2APP_M
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1712        Verify that:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1713          1. each Application in OsCfg_AppRefs except the last is a non NULL_PTR,
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_Application.c	  1714          2. OsCfg_AppRefs has a size equal to OS_APPID_COUNT + 1 and
